    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-c4a5e89d-51b6-4201-9cc3-0dbf46a6711b" n="0114" facs="#m-36423548-03f1-4ae2-988e-cea47487f818" /><div xml:id="m-59d40094-8886-414d-ab55-0ba9b3020fbb">
            <lg xml:id="m-cf5d1a51-f877-4cf1-b687-eeab65c90c45">
              <l xml:id="m-5fe3d9bf-9509-49a6-9ae4-7d1ea99c5b93" facs="#m-2fc8fa8f-6005-4430-aadd-cb462976c9d4" label="text-like">The Ordinary of the Mas¬</l><l xml:id="m-3062e80a-2773-429a-8d26-7b95d9bcbee9" facs="#m-59360820-7567-459d-8a37-4cf3802352e0" label="ambiguous">Vere dignum et justum est,</l><l xml:id="m-7c05b16c-a7be-428f-b898-e879b706da97" facs="#m-4385117b-3375-48a8-b2fb-a340e47a2316" label="text-like">During the Octave of Christmas:</l><l xml:id="m-c4a2b1d0-0d2f-42e2-a245-59a265327ea2" facs="#m-71fbdab3-bd74-418d-835b-fce368a1b98b" label="lyrics-like">aequum et salutáre, nos tibi semper,</l><l xml:id="m-5b17c9c8-1f42-4344-84b3-a9aa4d6fe448" facs="#m-a4c5d77c-2416-4080-ac9a-0c30ae20ee18" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes, et diem (noctem) sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-97e37c5a-6eb6-447f-8232-abcb54d96f7c" facs="#m-eeb948a5-f336-41b9-9914-ce5ef81c128d" label="lyrics-like">et ubique grátias ágere: Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-121f7fe8-1948-46a2-8a22-f1a5a00690a7" facs="#m-071fbc42-ed72-41a8-8892-6c4485e3c5a8" label="lyrics-like">cratissimum (-am) celebrántes, quo (qua)</l><l xml:id="m-ba459669-aa43-43b1-a1a4-be2e26632cc6" facs="#m-fa917ac4-13b9-4262-a87c-fda371e873ff" label="lyrics-like">sancte, Pater omnipotens, aetérne</l><l xml:id="m-65cf56f9-3152-44f7-a2f5-c1c02ba5d3fc" facs="#m-23b61323-f3b2-48c3-85e5-7db90cc98c59" label="lyrics-like">beátae Mariae intémeráta virginitas huic</l><l xml:id="m-c609a87f-4d5a-4ba6-8206-14b1c84bffde" facs="#m-14088378-3a2a-4643-8f23-ad666f5e31bd" label="lyrics-like">Deus : per Christum Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e4e9a8c-15c1-446e-86ec-4c8c759686e3" facs="#m-b280e74d-0b1c-4313-b38b-7d6adb31cc59" label="lyrics-like">mundo édidit Salvatórem: sed et me¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8cc4fc0-8e1b-457f-a54b-2dc9543d42d4" facs="#m-8d982170-0cb3-41fc-827d-c8a8716107c4" label="lyrics-like">strum. Per quem majestátem tuam</l><l xml:id="m-bbe69fd6-bc08-4bb7-a87d-c69b023f55e0" facs="#m-7714fecc-8355-4b5a-8a2b-d1137cbe3c11" label="lyrics-like">móriam venerántes, in primis ejusdem</l><l xml:id="m-fc1dc51c-6e60-423a-bad4-8fc21592bd62" facs="#m-1e962b67-416c-4766-ab56-47e1386277c9" label="lyrics-like">taudant Angeli, adórant Domina¬</l><l xml:id="m-f98f103a-0bbf-4357-b4c4-3524c27cdbcc" facs="#m-9ff8be40-934d-4b22-b8c1-bc4e41f8d729" label="lyrics-like">gloriósae semper Virginis Mariae, Geni¬</l><l xml:id="m-913c776d-6a22-4d3c-bfd6-00fa3b32b7ae" facs="#m-a76d12f6-9c4b-4ba8-8420-a6aa450c9269" label="lyrics-like">tiónes, tremunt Potestâtes. Caeli,</l><l xml:id="m-b7d540d5-a795-4e50-b49a-d0aa123d4c2b" facs="#m-8b0ffdc3-9297-4fa3-9337-d65823714583" label="lyrics-like">tricis ejúsdem Dei et Dómini nostri Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-3aff1429-21a5-47c6-9f75-84f6973fda95" facs="#m-d27beebb-27ad-4d68-9ec2-b3ac50cc5028" label="lyrics-like">caelorúmque Virtútes, ac beáta Sé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a5677510-25e4-47b5-8a76-bad8096bae72" facs="#m-d6ed5a91-c947-40b5-951f-48c777b41c1e" label="ambiguous">Christi:</l><l xml:id="m-07e9a696-2d99-41e4-a329-df0fc8697234" facs="#m-27e67d18-5572-4804-b5ea-3e16327422f3" label="lyrics-like">raphim, sócia exsultatióne concé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d2d2aef-770d-48fb-8b62-d1d4d6716121" facs="#m-4da3355b-2320-4a46-abc3-85886ed7f2ad" label="text-like">During the Octave ot the Epiphany:</l><l xml:id="m-dce60e37-ff58-490a-9bac-833237c9012a" facs="#m-9518ef87-2816-4ecf-a43d-5a2776f5d624" label="ambiguous">lebrant. Cum quibus et nostras vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-83e3a0ec-2adb-482e-8c00-d2c956f199ef" facs="#m-18b18284-0fc6-4911-934a-462a21a56929" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes, et diem sacratissi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a96b49f9-6116-4c15-a4e0-2dfd00f61d1a" facs="#m-4e79fd95-0f14-4c3e-ae79-e22c55c86bf3" label="lyrics-like">ces, ut admitti jubeas, deprecámur,</l><l xml:id="m-8c2aa776-47a3-441a-bb70-6efcec33cafd" facs="#m-8e5ca37d-81bc-45bf-b4bb-d18b2cf526a0" label="lyrics-like">mum celebrántes, quo Unigénitus tuus</l><l xml:id="m-ff3ac8a9-5efa-4066-8686-0111a9810a04" facs="#m-bc5f69bc-ea6c-4cf8-bba1-c571ccba271f" label="lyrics-like">súpplici confessióne dicéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-16af8511-1e70-428b-b87e-f51b62df6311" facs="#m-8a7d4b3b-8db7-4a59-a144-3cfce39f8da7" label="lyrics-like">in tua tecum glória coaetérnus, in veri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7b476ea-8cba-4daf-9077-4f3bdd853827" facs="#m-b1ccb1f0-5047-4b74-853a-832f5103f051" label="lyrics-like">Sanctus, Sanctus, Sanctus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-54815871-6684-46af-a2fa-301c6f9a6188" facs="#m-43a1a02d-27da-4fb0-84eb-d35551f213ee" label="lyrics-like">táte carnis nostrae visibiliter corporális</l><l xml:id="m-d742f1fa-d0f7-400b-b404-fd1eb14a996c" facs="#m-0ef0d969-c293-4bfa-9efc-ce1011c3c37d" label="lyrics-like">minus Deus Sábaoth. Pleni sunt</l><l xml:id="m-42034c13-957a-4358-896c-49b97c423c84" facs="#m-9c4b3478-2021-4a5b-9086-173c3803959d" label="lyrics-like">appáruit : sed et memóriam venerántes,</l><l xml:id="m-58553678-418b-4815-997c-ff8785007471" facs="#m-61cc8a1a-d1f4-4e1a-99f6-f4d33e0c26e8" label="lyrics-like">caeli et terra glória tua. Hosánna</l><l xml:id="m-edb331be-c750-4769-96a6-86b0087cf10f" facs="#m-3ddf802b-d3f0-48dd-b5f7-09cb95611c55" label="lyrics-like">in primis gloriósae semper Virginis</l><l xml:id="m-f5ec35ee-0098-4ebd-a140-7dd4c4f45c09" facs="#m-fad4f453-77a5-4b3c-9d7a-d63d1c4a8658" label="lyrics-like">in excélsis. Benedictus qui venit</l><l xml:id="m-ed847af8-d4e4-4d05-ae23-e1b6bb53d4b9" facs="#m-bfd8f522-bb01-40da-af63-f201018a81dd" label="lyrics-like">Mariae, Genitricis ejósdem Dei et Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e24f7e40-2ce5-421d-89f8-d81574d31c77" facs="#m-744fc8f0-576d-4a6c-b92d-b4064fcf2e5b" label="lyrics-like">in nómine Dómini. Hosánna in</l><l xml:id="m-315a43d1-09b9-4318-8a53-3113f8545c43" facs="#m-7cdc5b5b-6209-4a85-ab69-9c1de8b55d0b" label="ambiguous">mini nostri Jesu Christi:</l><l xml:id="m-1a1d29d7-cef4-4f84-b749-3edc84f6ce11" facs="#m-f6b0346a-7cc4-457c-9115-8d25a2d78641" label="lyrics-like">excélsis.</l><l xml:id="m-36819d8a-cbe3-4e41-bb93-d1ff3481d9b1" facs="#m-6d46f036-1987-4296-86e6-e77b90653379" label="text-like">During the Octave of Easter:</l><l xml:id="m-5b038d37-acd8-42e3-a45d-e518b8fa70d6" facs="#m-36db9965-14d8-4d26-b2c1-bf61364324bf" label="text-like">CANON OF THE MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-66649366-11bc-4ea7-8b84-7c866ed215e8" facs="#m-dacd1518-88ba-44ad-817b-aeac48833d14" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes, et diem (noctem)</l><l xml:id="m-c9cac064-b311-4454-a1d1-1ab8fceea774" facs="#m-ebd8eea6-0f96-42ba-bd6d-780e257fdf3c" label="lyrics-like">sacratíssimum (-am) celebrántes Resur¬</l><l xml:id="m-49d099e5-4eb7-415e-8165-ea915c55aa0b" facs="#m-54c169ce-4750-4013-b8b8-b0c16da1e8c2" label="lyrics-like">E igitur, clementíssime Pater,</l><l xml:id="m-0ef62f26-7ed5-4b58-a3d4-bd159c4d8563" facs="#m-43c7ce09-dd90-4bc0-ad3c-b4b234de384a" label="lyrics-like">rectiónis Dómini nostri Jesu Christi se¬</l><l xml:id="m-b818dce9-4cfd-47ce-9cf6-8b309a4cd157" facs="#m-af919682-e382-44ca-bc88-3bb76a32eb46" label="ambiguous">per Jesum Christum Filium</l><l xml:id="m-df13d124-d687-4a7d-b90f-fa7c077b99f5" facs="#m-99a98377-cd4d-449d-ab08-f23932e1ab6f" label="lyrics-like">cándum carnem: sed et memóriam</l><l xml:id="m-27aa9655-6cc1-4d4c-9a2a-92bbf3f548ae" facs="#m-e7241119-b8d0-4d56-af1e-56be3c4894f8" label="lyrics-like">tuum Dóminum nostrum, súpplices</l><l xml:id="m-0ce860cf-1d9e-4718-862b-86fb651f08f1" facs="#m-7de0f0d2-d61c-4835-b74f-0988eeb2e7a7" label="lyrics-like">venerántes, in primis gloriósae semper</l><l xml:id="m-46386be1-49d9-42eb-83a2-2777db5a5890" facs="#m-12051d06-4535-422e-83d8-c66bcc4f228f" label="lyrics-like">rogámus, ac pétimus, uti accépta</l><l xml:id="m-87a6f5b9-afa4-4be3-b53a-24236c8d9256" facs="#m-7845d141-d026-41d1-95ca-69d79b3b01d4" label="lyrics-like">Virginis Mariac, Genitricis ejúsdem Dei</l><l xml:id="m-bd2924a5-4fbf-4a74-af3a-0fb6256f076f" facs="#m-07cd039e-4e53-465d-a36d-92a7a164c27f" label="lyrics-like">hábeas, et benedicas haec dona,</l><l xml:id="m-62add9e2-38aa-4f20-950f-eb7bf0ba7bf9" facs="#m-fb948a36-b530-4cca-ac73-f3ba482a6d13" label="lyrics-like">et Domini nostri Jesu Christí:</l><l xml:id="m-6c60fa1d-58f4-4064-8f24-24827b1ddbf8" facs="#m-90da3a0a-7043-43d7-adcc-c6681c5a0842" label="lyrics-like">haec múnera, haec sancta sacrificia</l><l xml:id="m-ce2276e3-de94-4057-ba67-d15c23d26b44" facs="#m-154e7261-6ab0-4620-9b88-568a4c13dcce" label="text-like">During the Octave of the Ascension:</l><l xml:id="m-02e5b36d-810f-42dd-976b-7f1e5d19b3f3" facs="#m-51eb2c93-72f4-4923-a034-86a09a843f9e" label="lyrics-like">illibáta, in primis, quae tibi offéri¬</l><l xml:id="m-f17f52af-db36-456a-8273-630c40eb042e" facs="#m-e032c0c3-759b-43ee-bd48-e26130f4d459" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes, e diem sacratis¬</l><l xml:id="m-149313b9-6378-4a3e-bbdd-8f9dd4e5b5af" facs="#m-4d9fc116-07c5-442e-8258-8ae66833ee54" label="lyrics-like">mus pro Ecclésia tua sancta cathó¬</l><l xml:id="m-0aedc63f-59cc-422b-9271-a2e5253aec28" facs="#m-95ba9efb-0df1-4b69-9783-9d1526640ef2" label="lyrics-like">simum celebrántes, quo Dóminus noster,</l><l xml:id="m-cdd629e7-d011-4993-af2d-e8fce56fa327" facs="#m-2fca316f-2ab9-4e0b-a03d-6cc77b2ab6aa" label="lyrics-like">lica: quam pacificâre, custodire,</l><l xml:id="m-35525a8c-3a4d-4c34-8c4f-4b8f0dcfebbf" facs="#m-6a8e2845-c191-48f2-bdf7-b79c5fa1e440" label="lyrics-like">unigénitus Filius tuus, unitam sibi fra¬</l><l xml:id="m-37fc4a51-07c6-4dcd-b7ff-a8b8acd84c62" facs="#m-0caf08fc-5606-428d-b410-2d52a5826d64" label="lyrics-like">adunare, et régere dignéris toto</l><l xml:id="m-c5d7d0d5-96f1-4c86-9059-67a794ca65d8" facs="#m-30272ffe-48a5-4838-a432-c5590fb1709c" label="lyrics-like">gilitátis nostrae substántiam in glóriae</l><l xml:id="m-db25d538-8c89-4a7c-a9ea-a6a97a72fad8" facs="#m-ad810738-6e9e-4c6e-8252-2da116153535" label="lyrics-like">orbe terrárum: una cum fámulo</l><l xml:id="m-120866bb-bd42-46ee-b1c1-e2fde7aba081" facs="#m-aaae4030-d55b-404d-9d43-c71ac8972b09" label="lyrics-like">tuae déxtera collocávit : sed et memó¬</l><l xml:id="m-56b34a89-7f0e-40b2-a808-be9e10119075" facs="#m-e82c37db-9ebd-4f72-8268-822d9d9a21a1" label="lyrics-like">tuo Papa nostro N. et Antístite no¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1b816c2-da71-41ac-9d2e-873ca8f88c87" facs="#m-204bd082-14ba-48df-9d23-15ba04e071c6" label="lyrics-like">riam venerántes, in primis gloriósae</l><l xml:id="m-fb96f4d1-1087-4afb-993d-3ba0fbb54141" facs="#m-ccb1c797-852d-4239-9beb-83344d78cce8" label="lyrics-like">stro N. et ómnibus orthodóxis, at¬</l><l xml:id="m-22a171eb-0e28-409a-a469-39129f687e89" facs="#m-b0122079-c11e-4f1d-96ae-7ff2c37772c7" label="lyrics-like">semper Virginis Mariae, Genitricis eiús¬</l><l xml:id="m-37ef114b-6338-44cb-8e27-f7fb8972bcf1" facs="#m-ba5bd316-382d-413e-8555-2560d63a19b5" label="lyrics-like">que cathólicae et apostólicae fidei</l><l xml:id="m-cb5b0fc5-763c-4314-9e18-3e133236d4d1" facs="#m-4f10c94b-54be-4841-9dd6-d25820e9e73f" label="lyrics-like">dem Dei et Dómini nostri Jesu Christi:</l><l xml:id="m-18f33e73-3a95-4cf9-9723-317ea5177609" facs="#m-d71437a5-fe76-48c1-9788-478e745f7295" label="lyrics-like">cultóribus.</l><l xml:id="m-2ecac229-5568-47d7-9389-ea929ada9cb7" facs="#m-8ceffc83-933b-4d18-a22d-b96b99dcf3a8" label="text-like">During the Octave of Pentecost:</l><l xml:id="m-f463dd5a-c1ec-414e-8539-8a711395d207" facs="#m-7bacc086-5962-4c03-9c94-9d6d8b9a3ca8" label="lyrics-like">Meménto, Dómine, famulórum</l><l xml:id="m-cfc4632e-e4f2-43b2-b3e9-8db534697b75" facs="#m-4dbed5d7-b863-4d8e-a58c-c4a66aa84322" label="ambiguous">Communicantes, et diem sacratis¬</l><l xml:id="m-8099ac10-552f-4f53-9f60-499c9034ae87" facs="#m-cf0bccd8-25c7-4110-8340-ccee59cea665" label="lyrics-like">famularúmque tuárum, N. et N.; et</l><l xml:id="m-ff82a887-abdb-4e47-8f90-31d5b79fdf83" facs="#m-a29f7b10-4087-4afc-8263-77fe5730e048" label="lyrics-like">simum Pentecóstes celebrántes, quo</l><l xml:id="m-5e2516a8-7bde-4837-9d77-987ed64d4604" facs="#m-66d669c4-785d-42a7-b1fb-ef774bc2950b" label="lyrics-like">ómnium circumstántium, quorum</l><l xml:id="m-d00a7242-c93e-454c-8893-804a83098aa9" facs="#m-fbebc32b-6f2b-4797-84d0-329e87b3675b" label="lyrics-like">Spíritus Sanctus Apóstolis innúmeris</l><l xml:id="m-c42a812d-aa35-4398-8e4f-39e05a38d8a2" facs="#m-5b8775b2-39f2-4884-a162-4310b2d6e56e" label="lyrics-like">tibi fides cógnita est, et nota devó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7945cf11-6d8d-4bff-92ea-7d4415c7ae3b" facs="#m-11e72363-47a5-4e16-94e5-9f8d3266faee" label="lyrics-like">linguis appáruit: sed et memóriam</l><l xml:id="m-1d8235a3-7573-4849-870c-ff7fc8be60f1" facs="#m-f66bf5a9-7237-41db-824e-859df979a8d0" label="lyrics-like">tio, pro quibus tibi offérimus : vel</l><l xml:id="m-0b9bb4be-1aac-4a40-95a6-e1dbe45d38eb" facs="#m-3825ec2a-849d-49e7-8315-ff0dd2a507c3" label="lyrics-like">venerántes, in primis gloriósae semper</l><l xml:id="m-00ab2607-e1d3-43fc-b06f-9e1a7c47e9dd" facs="#m-ae80da33-4bff-47d6-becf-440dbeb7eaee" label="lyrics-like">qui tibi ófferunt hoc sacrificium</l><l xml:id="m-90cc9cfb-623f-438c-92d9-96c075bea1e3" facs="#m-fd7387b5-7362-4617-9116-0b0ad121be39" label="lyrics-like">Virginis Mariae, Genitricis Dei et Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-aaa255af-6875-479a-8658-e2704e465c06" facs="#m-b535cbd3-24f3-4fc1-af31-d324c9797a4b" label="lyrics-like">laudis, pro se, suisque ómnibus:</l><l xml:id="m-84a98c9e-8382-4b68-98f6-496d1611e95d" facs="#m-5ea57cba-65d8-4bde-9877-f90280c684fe" label="ambiguous">mini nostri Jesu Christi:</l><l xml:id="m-53c5fbab-669c-40ac-bd2d-7a1c6b7482d9" facs="#m-8cfd7222-3a8a-49c3-bda5-c6625b013f56" label="lyrics-like">pro redemptióne animárum suá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fcac6df-eb8c-4e67-9fb7-4808fd82a43a" facs="#m-f2c8a51e-2f93-4013-8000-439109917849" label="lyrics-like">rum, pro spe salútis, et incolumitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-066d527e-2ee1-45e1-a4ea-f2c43b768ea9" facs="#m-4c3c1404-752b-437c-9e8d-5ef799110fef" label="lyrics-like">tis suäe: tibique reddunt vota sua</l><l xml:id="m-f606f367-5121-45be-b018-cb27b4d47139" facs="#m-947d02ee-06f8-40e2-9b11-17c12f57fdf5" label="lyrics-like">sed et beatórum Apostolórum ac</l><l xml:id="m-eb1cabb2-2a30-4bad-9068-07d7bbfdd173" facs="#m-7b6591b7-a8ea-4c77-a4e5-78ff0c486051" label="lyrics-like">actérno Deo, vivo et vero.</l><l xml:id="m-10858cc2-687d-4c86-98ca-5b8d179d661c" facs="#m-b4acbcff-faaf-4e4e-bf12-18712bdbc170" label="lyrics-like">Mártyrum tuórum, Petri et Pauli,</l><l xml:id="m-94a9dbf8-128c-4bdc-b492-24f48842b492" facs="#m-b554bd8d-6cbe-44e3-b86f-53d01d91b888" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes, et memóriam</l><l xml:id="m-fcc3a79d-bfec-4eb6-b7c8-eb20be7e70b0" facs="#m-0a56d7b7-1fcd-4526-8890-9854da97c0a4" label="lyrics-like">Andréae, Jacóbi, Joánnis, Thomae,</l><l xml:id="m-6d52e8e1-1ee8-46f7-8f73-5242f8c1e2ec" facs="#m-1c61f6e8-19f6-4a16-9f10-660c28c311da" label="lyrics-like">Jacóbi. Philippi Bartholomaei,</l><l xml:id="m-0d8d693a-0d4a-461a-bb53-13cb2d3d6216" facs="#m-9118689e-c2bd-4797-9225-3ddca5a15bf4" label="lyrics-like">venerántes, in primis gloriósae sem¬</l><l xml:id="m-90bb78b2-e3ab-430f-af15-238068f5e17b" facs="#m-bb677980-78ab-4fbd-a525-cd0b630de58f" label="ambiguous">per Virginis Marlae, Genitricis Dei</l><l xml:id="m-87aade26-52a6-4787-8e81-67111d536133" facs="#m-7bb3c7f5-2955-405b-8a37-b2da47644887" label="lyrics-like">Matthaéi, Simónis et Thaddaéi</l><l xml:id="m-51d11480-3a94-4c73-9667-c7813127bbeb" facs="#m-112a1dec-9fbb-4d1e-80c7-e5d1d77eda3a" label="lyrics-like">Lini, Cleti, Cleméntis. Xysti, Cor¬</l><l xml:id="m-c47b6061-d73c-4b96-bee6-cde36b9b595f" facs="#m-795b7190-e4f8-4fc5-9a64-d39d922dc7aa" label="lyrics-like">et Dómini nostri Jesu Christi:</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>